  "title": "Unbundle derives its outputs from the incoming Cluster",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Unbundle derives its outputs from the incoming Cluster",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The saved node still records one historical row, while its actual incoming Cluster has three fields. Loading and compilation must expose all three outputs without changing that authored count or losing hidden fields.\n\nThe saved node still records one historical row, while its actual incoming Cluster has three fields. Loading and compilation must expose all three outputs without changing that authored count or losing hidden fields.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: studio.native.composed@1.\nExpected:\nnumber-result (i64) = 9007199254740993\ntext-result (string) = \"kept\"\nflag-result (bool) = true\n",
